{
  "Items.CaninePepperepper.After": "A gentle warmth spreads through your body, leaving you feeling stronger and quicker."
  "Items.CaninePepperepper.Black": "This black pepper tastes sweet, but has a bit of a tangy aftertaste."
  "Items.CaninePepperepper.Bulby": "You eat the pepper, even the two orb-like growths that have grown out from the base."
  "Items.CaninePepperepper.Double": "The double-pepper is strange, looking like it was formed when two peppers grew together near their bases."
  "Items.CaninePepperepper.Knotty": "The pepper is a bit tough to eat due to the swollen bulge near the base."
  "Items.CaninePepperepper.Large": "The pepper is so large and thick that you have to eat it in several large bites."
  "Items.CaninePepperepper.Standard": "The pepper tastes particularly potent, searingly hot and spicy."
}
